    HX_HBA_L008 49 : Bool @ %M1071.0 ACCESSIBLE VISIBLE WRITABLE COMMENT "LATCH for 'iDB_HopperBlockageMonitor.IO.HopperBlockedAlarm', PHASE-ARMED. Set only while this slot's start bool is high AND 'iDB_HopperBlockageStim.Stim.Armed' is true, and RESET by the copy layer whenever the start bool is low - so every vector index re-arms it and index 2 cannot read index 1's firing. A momentary signal cannot be sampled at any rate, so this is the only way it is observable at all. Bool, bit 0 of this register."
    HX_HBA_L009 4C : Bool @ %M1073.0 ACCESSIBLE VISIBLE WRITABLE COMMENT "LATCH for 'iDB_HopperBlockageMonitor.IO.HopperBlockStopReq', PHASE-ARMED. Set only while this slot's start bool is high AND 'iDB_HopperBlockageStim.Stim.Armed' is true, and RESET by the copy layer whenever the start bool is low - so every vector index re-arms it and index 2 cannot read index 1's firing. A momentary signal cannot be sampled at any rate, so this is the only way it is observable at all. Bool, bit 0 of this register."
